  "limitations": [
    "AC power was verified from the host before and after each run; power was not continuously monitored. No thermal warning was reported; this is not continuous thermal instrumentation.",
    "No competing model or agent compiler jobs ran during the timed series. Ordinary desktop graphics were active; exclusive physical GPU access is not claimed.",
    "Qwen still exhibits a repeatable approximately 25% throughput drop from the committed historical timing baseline. Rebuilding that historical source reproduces the drop; its cause remains unknown. The controlled comparison does not erase or waive this failure.",
